WEBVTT

00:04:58.516 --> 00:05:01.116
where absolutely every little
nook and cranny might be.

00:05:01.116 --> 00:05:03.716
There are no more
Mariana Trenches to be found.

00:05:03.756 --> 00:05:05.236
Imagine we're in our submarine,

00:05:05.276 --> 00:05:08.116
this is us diving in the submarine,
see, it's very spacious.

00:05:08.116 --> 00:05:09.996
It has all the latest mod cons,

00:05:09.996 --> 00:05:12.556
the sunlight diminishes very,
very quickly in the top,

00:05:12.556 --> 00:05:14.196
maybe in the first two minutes.

00:05:14.236 --> 00:05:17.836
It goes that fast and you see
that it does get dark very quickly.

00:05:17.876 --> 00:05:20.676
And as we descend down
through the water column,

00:05:20.716 --> 00:05:23.436
we're always being told
that the water is very, very cold.

00:05:23.436 --> 00:05:24.716
Very, very icy cold water.

00:05:24.756 --> 00:05:26.436
And yeah, it's cold.

00:05:26.436 --> 00:05:29.556
It's not anywhere near as cold as most,

00:05:29.596 --> 00:05:33.236
if not all of the winters I've ever
endured until moving to Australia.